slayer-editor (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Kate-style split view with shared documents.
  * Code folding (braces and Python indentation).
  * Language Server Protocol: diagnostics and completion (clangd, pylsp,
    Pyright, Ruff, typescript-language-server, rust-analyzer, gopls, jdtls,
    bash-language-server), configurable per language.
  * Kate-style status bar: git branch, cursor, insert mode, tabs, encoding.
  * Text encoding per document (reload/save with encoding, BOM detection).
  * Help with keyword search (F1), About menu, Save As / Save All buttons.
  * Closing the last tab shows a welcome screen; no default project folder.
  * Removed the destructive command guard (Android only).

 -- Prof. Wyllian <wyllianbs@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:30:00 -0300

slayer-editor (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Settings dialog: profiles, editor, appearance, terminal, languages,
    security and files.
  * Per-language tool, flags and extensions; custom languages.
  * Destructive command guard for the embedded bash terminal.
  * Code completion (file words + keywords), line numbers, word wrap,
    current-line highlight and cursor blink toggles.
  * Toolbar button and interface scale.

 -- Prof. Wyllian <wyllianbs@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:10:00 -0300

